nches in 2023  the sequel to The acclaimed Dungeon  Crawler continues the exploration of the  stresses of adventuring both mental and  physical instead of exploring Mass  dungeons 500 feet below the ground  darkest dungeon 2 puts your band of  adventurers on a massive road trip  however this is no pleasure Cruise the  road has hordes of monsters that will  attack with famine and disease with each  encounter gradually picking at the  mental fortitude of your party members  what will your adventure cost find out  when darkest dungeon 2 launches in 2023  wo long Fallen Dynasty is the latest  game from Neo creators team ninja based  on the old Guan zhong's novel Romance of  the Three Kingdoms wulong is an action  RPG set in China just before the start  of the Three Kingdoms period part of the  character creation includes choosing the  specific phase or combat style you want  to start with these are used to decide  which spells you start with your stats  and which Divine Beast will join you in  your fight instead of katana wielding  action like Neo wallong will be based on  traditional martial arts and weapon  rearranging from glaves swords staffs  and more rack up hits against your  opponent's Spirit meter a la sakuro to  break their posture and deliver the  finishing blow become the hero of three  kingdoms China when woh long Fallen  Dynasty Launches on all systems on March  3rd 2023  [Music]  become one of the legendary dark  Crusaders and quests to defeat adir the  demon god in Lords of the Fallen journey  across both the land of the living and  the dead using your Lantern to switch  from realm to realm at will this can be  used to unlock hidden areas treasure  hunt and manipulate the very soul of  your foe that's intense Journey Through  the Realms of umbral and Axiom alone or  uninterrupted with friends but be warned  enemy heroes from other Realms can  invade your game in true Dark Souls  fashion Lords of the Fallen is expected  to launch on all consoles in 2023  